  "id": 381,
  "description": "⚠️**THE DISCORD IS MANDATORY**⚠️  \nTo postulate: Send a request on discord &amp; in the game\n\n**https://discord.gg/stnVPR67YC**\n\nWelcome to Memento Mortem,\n\nWe are a guild that prioritizes having fun over competition, though we still aim to make progress!\n\n**GeekVax, Tsudaiy, Blenderman and Derogard** offer a simple management style to ensure the guild’s longevity. If you&#039;re an active player who isn’t looking for a strict guild, you&#039;re in the right place.\n\nHowever, to join us and enjoy a pleasant experience, there are a few rules to consider.\n\n💥**Requirements**\n- Battle level 70 required\n- Participation in raids\n- A reasonable contribution to challenges or Raid is required at least every two days.\n- Absence for more than 14 days without justification will result in a kick from the guild.\n- To join the Guild, send a request on the discord and on the game. \n\n📅 **Raids Schedule on Monday to Friday**\n- 6 PM UTC+2- Level 70\n- 7 PM UTC+2 - Level 70\n\n📅 **Assault Shedule on Friday, Saturday and Sunday**\n- Cities are selected each week - 1PM (UTC+2) for 8 hours\n\n🗨️ **Discord**\n- Discord is mandatory. Please submit your request in the &quot;waiting room&quot; channel on Discord while also applying in the game.\n- Discord link: **https://discord.gg/stnVPR67YC**\n\nSee you soon, Memento Mortem!",
